## Step 7: Variable Name Conflicts

Watch for variable names that shadow constants or conflict with local scope.

### Problem

```glsl
const float ZZ = 11.0;  // constant

vec4 render(...) {
    vec3 ZZ = normalize(...);  // shadows constant!
}
```

### Fix

Rename either the constant or the variable:

```glsl
const float ZZC = 11.0;  // renamed constant

vec4 render(...) {
    vec3 ZD = normalize(...);  // renamed variable
}
```

