## Step 8: Boolean/Float Type Mixing

### Problem

```glsl
if(z > 0.0 && (d > 0.0 && z < d || isnan(d)))  // isnan returns bool, mixed with float comparison
```

### Fix

Break into explicit boolean variables:

```glsl
bool validZ = z > 0.0;
bool validD = d > 0.0 && z < d;
bool nanD = d != d;  // isnan replacement
if(validZ && (validD || nanD)) { ... }
```

