## Step 10: Texture Sampling

### Shadertoy

```glsl
texture(iChannel0, uv)  // WebGL 2.0 syntax
```

### shader-web-background

```glsl
texture2D(iChannel0, uv)  // WebGL 1.0 syntax
```

